    "This master's degree is the final step in the telecommunication engineering path in Spain. It covers topics such as optical communications, microelectronics and software-defined networks.",
    "For my <strong>final master's project</strong>, I implemented an artificial neural network system for the early detection of Alzheimer's disease. The system was implemented in Python, using libraries such as TensorFlow and NumPy.",
    "The neural network was based on a variational autoencoder. The main idea was to reduce the high dimensionality of an MRI or PET image to a few dimensions, allowing the algorithm to capture the intrinsic characteristics needed to detect the disease."
